	(gr_text_box "There are two types of power sources, Vin and 3.3V.\nVin can be in the range of 3.6V~6V and regulated down to 3.3VR.\nTo select the power source, user can connect VDD pin of J1 with either 3.3VR or 3.3V.\nDo not populate R3 and R4.\n\nInt1 = Accelerometer's interrupt 1\nInt2 = Accelerometer's interrupt 2\nInt3 = Gyroscope's interrupt 1\nInt4 = Gyroscope's interrupt 2\nInt5 = Magnetometer's interrupt"
		(start 27.0316 50.1446)
		(end 117.0416 163.4746)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
